Subject: [PATCH] Session 3 addendum: add GET /api/approvals (list endpoint gap
 close-out)

- The 0014_approvals migration's own comment said this table would be
  queried both ways (per-case and practice-wide dashboard) but only the
  two write actions (approve/request-changes) were ever built.
- Adds listApprovals in approvals.controller.js, mounted as GET /api/approvals.
- Supports caseId, practiceId (internal-only), status, stage, page, limit.
- Tenant-scoped via existing practiceScopeClause helper; NOT gated on
  can_approve_photos (that flag governs writes only, per client's own spec).
- Joined against cases + case_files in one query (case_number, patient_name,
  current_status, media file_name/file_url) to avoid extra round-trips.
- 5 new integration tests. Full suite: 149/149 passing, 13/13 suites,
  verified on a fully clean DROP DATABASE + migrate + seed.
- Logged in BUILD_LOG.md (Session 3 addendum) and PARALLEL_BUILD_PROTOCOL.md
  status board, per this project's own conventions.
